{"version":1,"id":"meghan-trainor-me-too","title":"Me Too","artist":"Meghan Trainor","key":"Am","bpm":null,"bpmSource":"unknown","sourceUrl":"https://www.cifraclub.com.br/meghan-trainor/me-too/?instrument=keyboard","instrument":"keyboard","lyrics":"included","timing":"estimated","timingModel":"qwen3.5:4b","credits":"Composed by: Peter Svensson, Jason Derulo, Eric Frederic, Meghan Trainor and J Kash","chords":[{"symbol":"G","canonical":"G","keyboardPitchClasses":[7,11,2],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"E","canonical":"E","keyboardPitchClasses":[4,8,11],"interpretation":null}],"lines":[{"id":"line-1","kind":"instrumental","text":"","columns":1,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-2","kind":"section","text":"[Guitar/Bass Riff]","columns":18,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-3","kind":"lyric","text":"VERSE [Guitar/Bass Riff]","columns":24,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-4","kind":"lyric","text":"Who's that sexy thing I see over there?","columns":39,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-5","kind":"lyric","text":"That's me, standin' in the mirror","columns":33,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-6","kind":"lyric","text":"What's that icy thing hangin' 'round my neck?","columns":45,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-7","kind":"lyric","text":"That's gold, show me some respect","columns":33,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-8","kind":"section","text":"[PD-C HORUS]","columns":12,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-9","kind":"lyric","text":"I thank god every day, that I woke up feeling this way","columns":54,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"E","column":22,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-10","kind":"lyric","text":"And I can’t help loving myself, and I don’t need nobody else, no!","columns":65,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"E","column":38,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-11","kind":"section","text":"[CHORUS – Guitar Bass Riff]","columns":27,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-12","kind":"lyric","text":"If I was you, I’d wanna be me too","columns":33,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-13","kind":"lyric","text":"I’d wanna be me too, I’d wanna be me…too","columns":40,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-14","kind":"lyric","text":"If I was you, I’d wanna be me too","columns":33,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-15","kind":"lyric","text":"I’d wanna be me too, I’d wanna be me…too","columns":40,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-16","kind":"section","text":"[VERSE 2 – Guitar/Bass Riff]","columns":28,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-17","kind":"lyric","text":"I walk in like a dime piece","columns":27,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-18","kind":"lyric","text":"I go straight to V.I.P.","columns":23,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-19","kind":"lyric","text":"I never pay for my drinks","columns":25,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-20","kind":"lyric","text":"My entourage behind me","columns":22,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-21","kind":"lyric","text":"My life's a movie, Tom Cruise","columns":29,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-22","kind":"lyric","text":"So bless me, baby, achoo","columns":24,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-23","kind":"lyric","text":"And even if they tried to","columns":25,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-24","kind":"lyric","text":"They can't do it like I do","columns":26,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-25","kind":"lyric","text":"[PD-C HORUS] and [CHORUS]","columns":25,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-26","kind":"section","text":"[BRIDGE – Guitar/Bass Riff]","columns":27,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-27","kind":"lyric","text":"Turn the bass up! Turn the bass up! Turn the bass up!","columns":53,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-28","kind":"lyric","text":"Let’s go!","columns":9,"beats":4,"changes":[]}]}